# ============================================================================
# GrammarBar .gitignore
#
# Two rules drive this file:
#   1. Nothing generated or downloaded is committed.
#   2. Nothing derived from third-party corpora is committed. See Eval/LICENSES.md.
# ============================================================================

# --- SwiftPM ----------------------------------------------------------------
.build/
.swiftpm/

# NOTE: Package.resolved is deliberately NOT ignored. Pinning dependency
# versions is a stated project requirement (plan v2 section 4.4), so it must be
# committed once external dependencies exist.

# --- Xcode / XcodeGen ------------------------------------------------------
# GrammarBar.xcodeproj is GENERATED from project.yml. Never hand-edit it and
# never commit it - edit project.yml and re-run `xcodegen generate`.
GrammarBar.xcodeproj/
.build-xcode/
DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/

# --- Benchmark: environment and downloaded weights -------------------------
Bench/.venv/
Bench/models/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log

# --- Eval: third-party data and everything derived from it -----------------
# BEA-2019 / LOCNESS is non-commercial research/education only, with no
# redistribution to third parties. JFLEG ships no LICENSE file at all.
# So the raw corpora AND the artefacts produced from them stay local.
Eval/data/
Eval/golden.jsonl
Eval/results/*.json
Eval/results/*.txt
Eval/RESULTS.full-corpus.md

# What IS committed from Eval/: the harness, the build script, provenance and
# licence docs, RESULTS.md, and golden.first-party.jsonl - the recon+authored
# subset, which contains no third-party text.

# --- Release artifacts (regenerated by Scripts/release.sh) ----------------
dist/

# --- macOS -----------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store

# Raw benchmark logs: bulky, regenerable, no analytical value.
Bench/gec/results/*.log
